Package: qore-amqp-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-amqp-module-doc
Description: AMQP 1.0 messaging and data providers for Qore
 This package provides native Apache Qpid Proton bindings and source/compiled
 helper modules for messaging, transactions and data provider integration.
 Compiler metadata, provider resources and translations are included.
 An AMQP 1.0 broker is needed for network messaging.

Package: qore-amqp-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-amqp-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's AMQP modules
 This package contains three HTML API references and unit/integration test
 examples for the AMQP bindings, helper and data provider modules.
